    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196020/extras/395313a87c98e5945bb97730f8306511.avif?t=1668723652\" /></div><br><strong>Disquiet</strong> is a multiplayer co-op game where you and your friends became ghost hunters.<br>The main goal of each mission is to <strong>identify</strong> and potentially <strong>exterminate</strong> the ghost using hunting equipment that is upgradable with experience points.<br>You earn experience points by successfully completing the mission objective, there are also 4 additional quests that you can do.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196020/extras/0443b0df6d28e1f5f095d4689faa1b1d.avif?t=1668723652\" /></div><br>The game itself has already <strong>4 maps</strong>, and some basic equipment.<br>It has also few different ghost types (which mean each game you play they differ from the last game) that are unique in their own way, you can identify them by using the given equipment (some ghost types may spawn usable items in the house) and analyzing their behavior.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In conclusion:</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><strong>4</strong> different maps<br>  </li><li><strong>8</strong> unique ghost types<br>  </li><li><strong>many</strong> items </li></ul><br>We are planning to add more content as soon as possible.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196020/extras/6c5396975f6c21e2f662bd522e5a5915.avif?t=1668723652\" /></div><br>If you want to contribute to the game join our <strong>discord</strong> server and let us know about features!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196020/extras/395313a87c98e5945bb97730f8306511.avif?t=1668723652\" /></div><br><strong>Disquiet</strong> is a multiplayer co-op game where you and your friends became ghost hunters.<br>The main goal of each mission is to <strong>identify</strong> and potentially <strong>exterminate</strong> the ghost using hunting equipment that is upgradable with experience points.<br>You earn experience points by successfully completing the mission objective, there are also 4 additional quests that you can do.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196020/extras/0443b0df6d28e1f5f095d4689faa1b1d.avif?t=1668723652\" /></div><br>The game itself has already <strong>4 maps</strong>, and some basic equipment.<br>It has also few different ghost types (which mean each game you play they differ from the last game) that are unique in their own way, you can identify them by using the given equipment (some ghost types may spawn usable items in the house) and analyzing their behavior.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In conclusion:</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><strong>4</strong> different maps<br>  </li><li><strong>8</strong> unique ghost types<br>  </li><li><strong>many</strong> items </li></ul><br>We are planning to add more content as soon as possible.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196020/extras/6c5396975f6c21e2f662bd522e5a5915.avif?t=1668723652\" /></div><br>If you want to contribute to the game join our <strong>discord</strong> server and let us know about features!",
